ALVA — Animated Ability HUD & Universal Cooldown Rebalance

Objective

Implement a polished, hero-shooter-inspired ability interface for keyboard and controller players during gameplay, together with a strict new universal cooldown policy.

This is an implementation task, not a mockup. Make the changes in the actual game, connect them to the existing gameplay systems, and test everything thoroughly.

The desired result should feel like a professionally designed fighting-game HUD, with a smooth, scroll-wheel-style transition between grounded and airborne moves.

The implementation must preserve Alva’s identity: pixel-art character abilities, minimal dark UI, clean typography, readable controls, and fluid combat.

Repository: hiyroscript/alva

