Non-negotiable requirements

The HUD must look excellent, not merely functional.

Ground and air ability rows must transition smoothly like a vertical scrolling wheel.

Artwork must be authentic to each character and each move.

Input labels must reflect actual keyboard bindings and remappable controller profiles.

Cooldowns must be visible and accurate.

Only 3-second and 5-second special cooldowns are permitted, excluding the universal 0.5-second repeat rule.

Ten-damage attacks get 5 seconds. Exceptional healing or hard-control effects get 3 seconds. Other moves receive no extra cooldown.

No character-specific hacks, duplicated combat timers, broken existing controls, or unfinished placeholder UI.

The final result should feel like the ability HUD was always part of Alva.
